    "group": "The Sanguinor",
    "summary": "Once per battle, for your whole army, as [your opponent's Charge phase](vsdata:core-rule/charge-phase) ends, in any battle round but the first, you can pick an enemy unit that has made a [Charge move](vsdata:core-rule/charge-move) in the phase. This unit can then carry out an [ingress move](vsdata:core-rule/ingress-move), and it has to be set up in [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) of the picked unit. Making that move still leaves this unit eligible to move.",
